# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0171.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Incoming SMTP -> Stalwart rules + ClamAV
External IMAP mailboxes -> 6 incremental collectors
6 incremental collectors -> External IMAP mailboxes: "verdict missing: defer"
Stalwart rules + ClamAV -> Shared PostgreSQL mailbox store: accepted / Junk
6 incremental collectors -> Shared PostgreSQL mailbox store: UID checkpoints + delivery receipts
IMAP / JMAP via Stalwart -> Shared PostgreSQL mailbox store
Authenticated submission -> Shared persistent queue
Shared PostgreSQL mailbox store -> Shared persistent queue: forwarding / server-generated mail
Shared persistent queue -> Amazon SES
Shared persistent queue -> Direct MX over IPv4
